&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join our Talent Pool to hear about opportunities across Raisin group!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you interested in challenging projects, technical innovation, implementing new ideas and solving complex problems?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our software,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Miles&lt;/strong&gt;, is an ERP software for finance, leasing, fleet and mobility management in the automotive industry. It is a complex end-to-end solution that includes front, mid and back office functions and can be extensively customized to the customer&#39;s needs through configuration. Our customers are leasing and financing companies from the automotive industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Implementation Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be part of a dynamic multidisciplinary unit and play a key role in creating, configuring, and assembling the foundational components of Sofico’s solution to support and enhance business processes. By collaborating closely with clients and project teams, you will design, implement, and deliver tailored solutions that meet the customer needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and refine customer requirements into detailed functional and system specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess existing Miles functionality and propose effective solution directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, execute and document configuration solution designs in collaboration with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct unit testing to ensure quality and reliability of configured solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely delivery and successful handover of solutions to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data migration, document management, and reporting from an in-depth understanding of customer solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Managers to align project solutions with the product’s roadmap and future developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior consultants and contribute to best practices and knowledge sharing across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead workshops and customer engagements to drive solution adoption and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skills and interests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You like to work on impactful projects in a dynamic and innovative environment, and are driven by collaboration with passionate professionals and contributing to delivering solutions that drive customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What else is expected:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluent in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;configuration or implementation consulting role&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably in a tech-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;software implementation lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;system configuration, testing, and documentation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;leading projects or mentoring team members&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We would like to welcome you to an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;international and multicultural company&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;that has been operating for over 30 years and is doubling in size every 5 years. Growth is our middle name, while we strongly adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;horizontal and open company culture&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re in the drivers&#39; seat of your own career, that&#39;s our motto. Your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;personal development&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is therefore paramount. During an extensive&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;onboarding program&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;of six months, we make you, with the support of your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;job coach&lt;/strong&gt;, familiar with our product and the organization. Even after this period, you will continue to get opportunities to learn and develop yourself further. You’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;never alone&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico you will also work in a modern state-of-the-art office that is easily&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;accessible&lt;/strong&gt;. We have plenty of safe charging points for your electric car.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In return for your efforts, we offer an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;extensive salary package&lt;/strong&gt;, including a company car, pension scheme and medical insurance. The &lt;strong&gt;flexible office hours&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;hybrid working policy&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;provide the necessary flexibility within the company.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico we are strong believers in the power of a good cup of coffee. Water or soft drinks are of course also on the menu. We love our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;team events&lt;/strong&gt;. Think after-work drinks, a BBQ, a family day, a company weekend, or a walking dinner with the whole company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the expert navigator for our most complex client projects. As a Senior Implementation Consultant, you leverage your deep industry knowledge and technical expertise to steer global automotive and leasing giants through critical software implementations. You don&#39;t just configure a system; you design the future operational landscape of our clients. In this pivotal role within a hidden champion of mobility tech, you act as a mentor to your team and a strategic partner to our customers, ensuring that our software &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Miles&lt;/strong&gt;&quot; delivers maximum impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute in large-scale implementation projects, from initial scoping to final delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You analyze intricate business requirements and design sophisticated solutions that push the boundaries of what is possible with Miles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act as a primary point of contact for key stakeholders, managing expectations and building strong, trust-based relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You mentor and coach junior and mid-level consultants, fostering a culture of excellence and continuous learning within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You identify opportunities for process improvements and contribute to the strategic roadmap of our implementation methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate closely with product management and development teams to translate market needs into new software features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skills and interests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built an impressive track record in software implementation, IT consulting, or business analysis over several years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess expert-level knowledge of the automotive finance, leasing, or fleet management industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in challenging environments and have successfully managed complex projects with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about sharing your knowledge and have experience in leading or mentoring teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine strong analytical skills with a pragmatic, solution-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be eligible, you must be an Australian Citizen, Permanent Resident, or have your own pathway to PR. Unfortunately, we are unable to offer visa sponsorship for this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico, you’ll join an international, multicultural company with over 30 years of success. We double in size every five years, staying true to our open and collaborative culture even as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe you should be in control of your own career. That’s why we put your personal development first. With an extensive onboarding program, you’ll spend six months learning our products and getting to know the organization with the support of a dedicated job coach. Your learning doesn’t stop there; we’ll continue to offer opportunities for growth and development throughout your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in a modern, accessible office with flexible and hybrid work options that allow you to balance work and life. In addition, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy continuous opportunities for learning and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite parking, EV Charging and walking distance from metro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a competitive salary, flexible office hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access novated leasing options and mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy complimentary coffee, soft drinks, breakfast and fruit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WFH 2 days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in team events, including afterwork drinks, BBQs, family days, and company weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The Senior Insights Data Analyst is a key contributor responsible for delivering complex data analytics projects and providing strategic insights that drive business decisions. Sitting at the intersection of operations, business intelligence, and tech, this role will serve as the driver for fast-paced, complex, and ambitious projects. With a strong command of statistical techniques and tools, this individual works with cross-functional teams to gather data, apply advanced analytical frameworks, and develop actionable insights that align with the company&#39;s strategic goals. This role works with minimal supervision, ensuring data accuracy and optimizing business processes through data-driven decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While not responsible for managing a team, the Senior Insights Analyst mentors junior analysts and collaborates closely with business leaders to deliver impactful results. The ideal candidate brings deep domain knowledge, a proactive mindset, and the confidence to share findings and influence decisions — even when not asked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive projects with minimal supervision, executing complex data queries and advanced analytical frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform ambiguous business challenges into viable analytical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply statistical techniques and AI to address business challenges, providing clear, data-driven insights to guide decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively structure projects, manage timelines, and provide relevant updates to key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertly steer meetings and communicate findings to both technical and non-technical stakeholders through visualizations and presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process, transform, and clean large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand HF&#39;s core products and business model, with a focus on optimizing operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior analysts, providing guidance and support in their development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in reporting, BI, data analysis, or a similar position with an operations focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced ability to model real-life business operations using assumptions and historical data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced ability to utilize large language models to guide and enhance tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding of inferential statistics for advanced analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with SQL, Python, and data visualization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong autonomy and proactive communication skills, with the confidence to share findings and challenge assumptions unprompted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious mindset with a proactive approach to problem-solving and expanding knowledge and skills&lt;/li&gt;
