&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of qualifying and closing consultative/service-led sales, particularly multi-year and subscription-based services, in complex environment and FSI industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
